  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: a20105d88834d764380d6090e8c10179, type: 3}
  m_Name: Farmer's Journal
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::NoteData
  title: Farmer's Journal
  content: "Harvest Log \u2014 Third Week of Spring\nI've worked these fields for
    over twenty years, yet I've never seen crops grow this quickly.\nAt first, we
    thought it was a blessing. The wheat stood taller than ever, and the vines reached
    the fences overnight.\nBut now the fruit ripens before it can properly mature,
    and by morning it's already begun to rot.\nIt seems as if the land itself isn't
    flourishing, but rather exhausting itself.\nIf this continues, there won't be
    any harvest left to save."
